# Task: Fix VACE Remote Video Path Bug

## Changelog

### 2026-02-25 - Fix VACE Remote Video Path Bug

**File Modified:** `FlipPix.UI/ViewModels/Video/VACEVideoViewModel.cs`

**Change:** Removed local Windows path construction for video input (node 14). Now passes just the uploaded filename directly to the workflow, matching the pattern already used for background/foreground images (nodes 24, 25).

**Before:**
```csharp
var comfyUIInputPath = Path.Combine(_settingsService.Settings?.ComfyUIFolderPath ?? "", "input", videoName);
WorkflowNodeUpdater.UpdateNodeInput(ref workflowJson, "14", "video", comfyUIInputPath);
```

**After:**
```csharp
WorkflowNodeUpdater.UpdateNodeInput(ref workflowJson, "14", "video", videoName);
```

**Fix:** `VHS_LoadVideoPath` node now receives just the filename instead of a Windows-local path, resolving the "Invalid file path: input\filename.mp4" error on remote ComfyUI servers.

